  | / impl<'b, Signature, ThreadKindFrom: ?Sized, ThreadKindTo: ?Sized>
  | |     AsRef<RcBlock<'b, Signature, ThreadKindTo>> for RcBlock<'b, Signature, ThreadKindFrom>
  | | where
  | |     ThreadKindFrom: BoundedBy<ThreadKindTo>,
  | |____________________________________________^ `AsRef<RcBlock<'_, Signature, ThreadKindTo>>`
...
  | / impl<'b, Signature, ThreadKindFrom: ?Sized, ThreadKindTo: ?Sized>
  | |     AsRef<Block<'b, Signature, ThreadKindTo>> for RcBlock<'b, Signature, ThreadKindFrom>
  | | where
  | |     ThreadKindFrom: BoundedBy<ThreadKindTo>,
  | |____________________________________________^ `AsRef<Block<'_, Signature, ThreadKindTo>>`
  = note: required for `dyn Any` to implement `block2::traits::BoundedBy<dyn Send + Sync>`
  = note: required for `RcBlock<'_, fn(), dyn Any>` to implement `AsRef<RcBlock<'_, fn(), dyn Send + Sync>>`

